xtras/7b0e520d1dc58b5265d3d1f15db626ed.mp4?t=1785921001\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2213700/extras/867f9716d6744f8d86443ee47fa9eaf9.avif?t=1785921001\" width=616 height=168 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Souls accumulate sins across their many lifetimes. Keep an eye on these levels and build specialized purification centres to stop corruption from spiralling out of control. Otherwise, you may have a monstrous demon on your hands or even worse, a devastating hit to your efficiency… truly diabolical.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2213700/extras/317394b531e01b5f6ccc925b98e56070.poster.avif?t=1785921001\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2213700/extras/317394b531e01b5f6ccc925b98e56070.webm?t=1785921001\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2213700/extras/317394b531e01b5f6ccc925b98e56070.mp4?t=1785921001\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2213700/extras/575c04787ea458635914a0f3f6256660.avif?t=1785921001\" width=616 height=168 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Office politics has never been so dangerous! Enact biblical-level corporate intrigues in the story-based campaign mode. Test your organizational mettle in Challenge Mode. Perfect the art of Hell building or slack-off for the day in the fully customizable Sandbox Mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2213700/extras/e74ff2330616761c53fe0cd95e7b9999.poster.avif?t=1785921001\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2213700/extras/e74ff2330616761c53fe0cd95e7b9999.webm?t=1785921001\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2213700/extras/e74ff2330616761c53fe0cd95e7b9999.mp4?t=1785921001\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Manage Hell. Manipulate the Overworld. Build the resurrection business of your dreams! In Sintopia, you’re tasked with managing the bureaucratic administration of Hell: “re-educate” the sinful, generate profit, play god and expand your hellish empire. All part of a day’s work at Hell Incorporated.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong>, German, Portuguese - Brazil, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Spain, Italian, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Russian, Spanish - Latin America, Traditional Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "reviews": "“A deep, charming, and constantly unpredictable experience that is well worth your time.”<br>4/5 – TheGamer<br><br>“Its visuals and humour will hook you early, but there’s enough depth to keep you playing for hours.”<br>8/10 – Jump Dash Roll<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2213700/cb8c74ab4bbbfac5476a865fb5a1d04a64045ac1/header_alt_assets_1.jpg?t=1785921001", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2213700/b037a37faf6cf2b8b62f99724574be5504fa997d/capsule_231x87_alt_as